<style>
  .community-header {
    font-size: 37px;
    max-width: 753px;
    line-height: 44px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }
  .community-grid {
    max-width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: min-content;
    column-gap: 20px;
    row-gap: 92px;
  }
  .community-cell {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: top;
    grid-column: span 1;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .community-cell .number {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .community-cell img {
    display: block; 
    width: 100%;
  }
  .community-cell p {
    display: block;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 4px 0 10px 0;
    max-width: 320px;
    line-height: 19px;
    min-height: 120px;
  }
  .community-cell a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .community-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: min-content;
    }
    .community-header {
        font-size: 27px;
        max-width: 753px;
        line-height: 33px;
        padding-bottom: 100px;
    }
  }
  
</style>

{% include "loading" %}

<div class="page-padding">

  <h1 class="page-title">Community Appreciation 03</h1>

  <div class="community-header">
    A collection of images of how people wear and interact with Adsum out in the world, and a tribute to the people who support us.
  </div>
  
  <div class="community-grid">
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">1</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/olivershaw/" target="_blank"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/swamisound/" target="_blank">@swamisound</a> recently took the <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/caliper-jacket-gazer-slate" target="_blank">Caliper Jacket</a> on his tour of Japan. We're big fans of his flavor of Garage music. The love goes round and round. 
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/356060941_781471660112155_437011021502664899_n.jpg?v=1689882800" alt="Swami Sound">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">2</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tdrl" target="_blank">@tdrl</a> has been a supporter since the earliest days of Adsum. Here in his native France he shows everyone exactly how we imagined styling the <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/nordic-crewneck-sweater-burnt-sienna" target="_blank">Nordic Vest</a>. A collaboration with Sweden's own Nitty Gritty. An international affair.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_0867-1.jpg?v=1689882594" alt="tdrl">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">3</div>
      <p>
        We love when girls wear our clothes. <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kawakiiiiii" target="_blank">@kawakiiiiii</a> took the <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/ike-hat-white" target="_blank">Ike Hat</a> onto the nightlit streets of Japan. 
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_0867-4.jpg?v=1689882604" alt="kawakiiiiii" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">4</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/calebflowers_" target="_blank">@calebflowers_</a>, the creator of Chillbies, paired his well loved creation with our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/merino-tech-wool-sock-royal-blue" target="_blank">Merino Tech Wool Sock</a> to great effect.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aaaIMG_9191.jpg?v=1690392699" alt="calebflowers_" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">5</div>
      <p>
        Our friend <a href="https://www.instagram.com/arco_maher/?hl=en" target="_blank">@arco_maher</a> took our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/run-short-black" target="_blank">Grid Run Short</a> to Chamonix to understandably get outside in one of the most beautiful places on earth.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aaaIMG_0973.jpg?v=1690391606" alt="Arco Maher" />
         </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">6</div>
       <p>
        Vests are underutilized. <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kjooonh/" target="_blank">@kjooonh</a> took our Camp Hero Vest and shows that they don't always have to be layered under a jacket.
      </p>  
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/347068169_173620882010963_6143343448894527826_n-opt.jpg?v=1689882953" alt="kjooonh" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">7</div>
       <p>
       <a href="https://www.instagram.com/nationfc/" target="_blank">@nationfc</a> is a great fishing brand from our neck of the woods. This isn't the first time we've heard the <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/cargo-tote-dried-leaf?_pos=1&_sid=7006a0077&_ss=r" target="_blank">Cargo Tote</a> is a great bag to take out on the boat.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/nationfcIMG_0970.jpg?v=1690228844" alt="nationfc" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">8</div>
      <p>
        We love Manchester lads, especially one's that take a break from downing pints in the pub to get outside in our Merrell collaboration on the Moab. Cheers <a href="https://www.instagram.com/george__thr/" target="_blank">@george__thr</a>.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/339997068_169796629328799_8718411415315069461_n-2_232a82c0-5863-4f67-ae2d-cf48abbfa3d5.jpg?v=1689883268" alt="george__thr" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">9</div>
      <p>
        Is tonal photography the visual equivalent of alliteration? Who knows and who cares, but the blue on blue from <a href="https://www.instagram.com/lenaonthefilm/" target="_blank">@lenaonthefilm</a> with our AdsumWorks tote is easy on the eyes.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/342373230_186391644243295_1392151680993568048_n.jpg?v=1689882609" alt="lenaonthefilm" />
    </div>

  </div>
  
</div>
  
